+## Sales and variance
+
+- `POST /import/sales` takes `{ "csv": "..." }` with the columns
+  `ticket,soldAt,dishId,qty` and answers `{ "tickets": n, "dishes": n }`
+  (`dishes` is the total `qty`). Tickets already imported are skipped. Any bad
+  row (`bad_request`) or shortage (`sale_stock`, 409) imports nothing; the
+  message names the row (`row 2` is the first data row).
